WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.572
Press kit.

00:00:01.522 --> 00:00:05.454
Everything a journalist needs to cover the TENET5 investigation.

00:00:05.454 --> 00:00:17.590
This page provides verified statistics with source citations, suggested story angles with links to full evidence chains, and a methodology statement explaining how every claim on this site is sourced from official government records.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.670
If you are a journalist, researcher, or elected official, this page is designed for you.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:26.636
Every number below is verifiable from the cited official source.

00:00:26.636 --> 00:00:28.886
We encourage fact-checking.

00:00:28.886 --> 00:00:31.772
We encourage independent verification.

00:00:31.772 --> 00:00:34.056
The information is public.

00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:37.727
The synthesis is what the captured media has not performed.
